* text=auto
* text eol=lf

# Windows forced line-endings
/.idea/* text eol=crlf

# Gradle wrapper
*.jar binary

# Images
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.otf binary

# Models and other opaque payloads.
#
# Without these, `* text=auto` decides for itself, and for at least one ONNX model it decided
# wrong: every 0x0D byte was stripped on commit. The file lost 130 bytes, stopped parsing, and
# translation failed on every page for every provider — with the copy on disk, the blob in git
# and the one inside the APK all agreeing, because all three had been through the same filter.
*.onnx binary
*.tflite binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.bin binary
*.so binary
*.dex binary
*.apk binary
*.aar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.pyc binary
*.swp binary
